flowchart TB
    Operator["Operator"] --> UI["Shared browser UI<br/>Trade / Compare / Liquidity / Portfolio<br/>Environment, mode, freshness and action status"]

    subgraph app["PROPOSED — one deployable application; one active execution owner"]
        API["FastAPI boundary<br/>Validated commands and read endpoints<br/>Local access boundary; authentication before remote use"]
        Reads["Read views<br/>Market freshness, orders, exposure<br/>Equity, cash flows and separate reward estimates"]
        Strategies["Arbitrage and LP strategies<br/>Produce explainable order intentions<br/>No direct exchange order writes"]
        Domain["Pure domain logic<br/>Book reconstruction, payoff relationships<br/>Prices, fees, sizing and accounting"]
        Data["Market-data service<br/>REST snapshots + WebSocket events<br/>Validity, timestamps and gap recovery"]
        Executor["Execution service — sole owner of order mutations<br/>Stable intent IDs, risk reservations, order lifecycle<br/>Submit / cancel / replace / pause"]
        Policy["Admission and risk policy<br/>Explicit arming, valid data, budget, ownership<br/>Cancel / recovery actions have their own policy"]
        Recovery["Reconciliation service<br/>Compare journal with exchange orders, fills, positions<br/>Unresolved outcomes retain exposure reservations"]
        Runtime["Lifecycle supervisor<br/>Single-instance guard, startup checks<br/>Task health, pause and bounded shutdown"]
        Portfolio["Portfolio and reward analytics<br/>Facts and estimates kept separate"]
        Broker["Broker interface<br/>Order origin selects adapter<br/>environment + mode + account + session"]
        Kalshi["Kalshi adapter<br/>REST reads and order writes; WebSocket input<br/>Signing, timeouts, rate budget, normalized errors"]
        Sim["Simulation adapter<br/>Isolated order / fill state<br/>Deterministic clock and explicit fill assumptions"]
        Store["Storage adapter<br/>Transactions, unique fill IDs<br/>Order / fill history and checkpoints"]
    end

    DB[("SQLite on a persistent local volume<br/>Environment / mode / account scoped records")]
    Exchange["Kalshi REST + WebSocket APIs<br/>Demo or production account"]
    Secrets["Runtime configuration and private key<br/>Outside Git and container images"]
    Fixtures["Synthetic or sanitized replay fixtures<br/>Offline demo and fault injection"]

    UI <-->|HTTP polling and commands| API
    API -->|queries| Reads
    API -->|manual trades, controls, strategy configuration| Executor
    API -->|read-only analysis| Portfolio
    Executor -->|validated configuration| Strategies
    Data -->|valid snapshots| Domain
    Domain -->|candidate decisions| Strategies
    Strategies -->|intentions| Executor
    Executor -->|check before new exposure| Policy
    Data -->|freshness and prices| Policy
    Reads -->|known and reserved exposure| Policy
    Executor -->|all submit / cancel / replace writes| Broker
    Executor <--> Store
    Store --> Reads
    Data --> Reads
    Portfolio --> Reads
    Domain --> Portfolio
    Store --> Portfolio
    Recovery -->|normalized facts for serialized application| Executor
    Recovery -->|read-only exchange reconciliation| Kalshi
    Recovery <--> Store
    Runtime -->|start / monitor / pause| Data & Executor & Recovery
    Broker -->|live orders, demo or production| Kalshi
    Broker -->|simulated orders| Sim
    Kalshi <-->|bounded network I/O| Exchange
    Kalshi -->|market events| Data
    Kalshi -->|private order / fill events| Executor
    Secrets --> Kalshi
    Fixtures --> Data & Sim
    Sim -->|simulated order / fill events| Executor
    Store <--> DB

    classDef ui fill:#eaf0ff,stroke:#4f6bdc,color:#172554
    classDef service fill:#eff8f6,stroke:#278579,color:#143e38
    classDef execution fill:#e1f3ee,stroke:#17705c,stroke-width:3px,color:#123e31
    classDef data fill:#fff5de,stroke:#b68a22,color:#583f0d
    classDef external fill:#f0f1f5,stroke:#737b8b,color:#242d3b
    class Operator,UI,API,Reads ui
    class Strategies,Domain,Data,Policy,Recovery,Runtime,Portfolio service
    class Executor execution
    class Store,DB data
    class Broker,Kalshi,Sim,Exchange,Secrets,Fixtures external
